                  },
                  "description": "Validation failure. The server cannot or will not process the request due to something that is perceived to be a client error. Possible causes could be:\n\n<ul>\n  <li>unsupported country code in EORI number (GB and XI are supported)</li>\n  <li>invalid format for EORI number</li>\n</ul>\n"
                },
